#: ../../resources/index.md:1
msgid "Useful Resources"
msgstr "Ressources utiles"

#: ../../resources/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Explore these curated resources designed to enhance your skills in shell "
"scripting, Linux, computing, and more:"
msgstr ""
"Explorez ces ressources sélectionnées, conçues pour améliorer vos "
"compétences en scripts shell, en Linux, en informatique et plus encore :"

#: ../../resources/index.md:5
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://swcarpentry.github.io/shell-novice\" "
"target=_blank>Shell Novice (Software Carpentry)</a>\\  A beginner-"
"friendly guide that introduces you to the Unix shell and basic command-"
"line operations. <br><br>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://swcarpentry.github.io/shell-novice\" "
"target=_blank>Shell pour débutants (Software Carpentry)</a>\\  Un guide "
"accessible aux débutants qui vous initie au shell Unix et aux opérations "
"de base en ligne de commande. <br><br>"

#: ../../resources/index.md:8
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://researchcomputing.princeton.edu/education/external-"
"online-resources/linux\" target=_blank>Princeton Linux Educational "
"Resources</a>\\  A collection of Linux tutorials and materials curated by"
" Princeton's Research Computing team for academic and research purposes. "
"<br><br>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://researchcomputing.princeton.edu/education/external-"
"online-resources/linux\" target=_blank>Ressources éducatives Linux de "
"Princeton</a>\\  Une collection de tutoriels et de ressources Linux "
"sélectionnés par l'équipe de calcul de recherche de Princeton à des fins "
"d'enseignement et de recherche. <br><br>"

#: ../../resources/index.md:11
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.calculquebec.ca/en/academic-research-"
"services/training\" target=_blank>Calcul Quebec Academic & Research "
"Training</a>\\  Courses and workshops aimed at enhancing computing skills"
" and supporting academic research initiatives. <br><br>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.calculquebec.ca/en/academic-research-"
"services/training\" target=_blank>Formation en recherche de Calcul "
"Québec</a>\\  Des cours et des ateliers visant à améliorer les "
"compétences en informatique et à soutenir les projets de recherche "
"universitaire. <br><br>"

#: ../../resources/index.md:14
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@alliancecan\" "
"target=_blank>AllianceCan YouTube Channe</a>\\  A YouTube channel "
"featuring a range of educational videos and tutorials on technology and "
"research innovations. <br><br>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@alliancecan\" target=_blank>Chaîne "
"YouTube AllianceCan</a>\\  Une chaîne YouTube proposant une gamme de "
"vidéos éducatives et de tutoriels sur les technologies et les innovations"
" en recherche. <br><br>"

